{
 "_about": "Music's shared interface (UI contract 1.2), a preview beside Music's own page and screens (docs/media-audio.md, milestone A1): an album, an artist, a mix, a radio station, a mood, a genre and a track's credits, each played through the client's audio host with the play action's tracks or route. Its entry pages (recently added albums, mixes and moods, genres) are temporary: A2 replaces them with Home, Library and Search. It binds to Music's existing routes; the pictures of mixes, moods and genres come from artwork/mosaic.",
 "contract": "starcore.ui/1.2",
 "title": "Music",
 "preview": true,
 "requires": {
  "client": [
   "media.audio"
  ],
  "capabilities": [
   "audio.library"
  ]
 },
